    "created_at": "2015-09-29T16:08:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-29T16:08:19Z",
    "body": "If they have been objected to by a majority we should definitely add warnings. Ideally we have the objections on record.\n\nIf we don't have objections we should figure out what the likelihood of it getting implemented is. And perhaps what the likelihood of getting it removed is.\n",
