    "created_at": "2015-10-05T08:28:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-05T08:28:16Z",
    "body": "We also have the reverse kind of situation, where a bad/silly/useless API is implemented by every vendor except one, as is the case with [`isSameNode()`](https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27424), [`initMessageEvent()`](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/223) and [`innerText`](https://github.com/whatwg/compat/issues/5).\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
